,"44 cases: no build solved them."],[68.5,72.0,"43 cases: every build solved them."],[72.5,76.0,"Now scatter the same wins at random."],[76.0,80.0,"Luck would leave 8.8 dark and 8.4 full."],[81.0,84.5,"Cut at six of six: 43 of 320 cases."],[84.5,88.5,"Only 13.4 % of cases are solved by all six."],[89.0,92.5,"Phone lines, regrouped by build."],[92.5,96.0,"Six builds: from 26.1 % to 52.1 %."],[97.5,101.5,"By kind of problem: 11.6 % to 67.7 %."],[102.0,106.0,"So the case matters more than the build."],[106.0,110.0,"Now the score: 53 tasks, four businesses."],[112.5,116.5,"The best builder scores 23.9 out of 100."],[118.5,122.5,"An expert who knows the test scores 82.2."],[123.0,127.0,"In banking: 5.9 against 79.8."],[129.5,133.5,"Last: what the builders asked the client."],[133.5,137.0,"15,885 tool calls. One cube each."],[138.0,142.0,"43 were questions to the client."]],"brand":{"takeaway":"Ask the client. Test on the hard cases."},"sources":[["S1","web/leaderboard/public/hyper-submissions/*/submission.json (six configurations x four domains) and reference.json (the expert row) · https://github.com/sierra-research/hyper-tau-bench (commit 6e9f34c685d40fa7a9f5935d8970af6fd9d5f118, 2026-09-06)"],["S2","web/leaderboard/public/build-trajectories/rel001..053.json: one sampled build per task, the 0/1 reward of every evaluation simulation, tool calls, messages to the Client · https://github.com/sierra-research/hyper-tau-bench (same commit)"],["S3","data/tau2/hyper/tasks/MANIFEST.md: 53 tasks = 6 airline_plus + 6 retail_plus + 6 telecom + 35 banking_knowledge · https://github.com/sierra-research/hyper-tau-bench (same commit)"],["S4","src/tau2/hyper/sandbox/orchestrator.py and performance.py: reward = max(0, pass rate - credit overage) x latency gate · https://github.com/sierra-research/hyper-tau-bench (same commit)"],["S5","Shi, Dhandhania, Narasimhan, Barres (Sierra), 2026-09-04, the benchmark paper · https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.04611"],["S6","this topic's recompute (reads the three JSON copies) · factory/topics/build-the-agent/data/recompute.py"]],"honest":["One sampled build per task, builders mixed: columns are different builds, not repeats; 23.9 is a mean over 53 tasks scored by simulated customers and an LLM judge."],"beat":0.5,"cuts":[],"libs":["arsenal/patterns/text-reveal/pattern.js","factory/kit2/text-reveal.js"]}